From 2e9bf135f7f2783feedf29105512fedbd48bb3c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Correa da Silva Sanches <juca@members.fsf.org>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 14:57:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/25] kn5000: Add DSP1 device stub (IC311 DS3613GF-3BA)

Replace noprw stub at 0x130000 with a proper device class that accepts
register writes via the register-indirect interface (address latch +
data port). The firmware initializes 4 DSP channels with 0x20-byte
register spacing.

DSP2 (IC310 MN19413) remains handled by SubCPU GPIO port callbacks
as it uses a serial bit-bang protocol rather than memory-mapped I/O.
---
 src/mame/matsushita/kn5000.cpp     |  8 ++-
 src/mame/matsushita/kn5000_dsp.cpp | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/mame/matsushita/kn5000_dsp.h   | 61 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 146 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 src/mame/matsushita/kn5000_dsp.cpp
 create mode 100644 src/mame/matsushita/kn5000_dsp.h

